    "blocks": [
      "Never stop on a motorway lane, slip road, or hard shoulder except in an emergency.",
      "If you break down, pull into an emergency area or hard shoulder. Exit away from traffic.",
      "Never put a warning triangle on a motorway, and wait behind the safety barrier."
